---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RelatedGuides from '../../components/ui/RelatedGuides.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Panama Company Formation for Foreigners — SA Panameña"
  description="Complete guide to forming a Sociedad Anónima (SA) in Panama: requirements, costs, timeline and why it's the most flexible economic tie for the Friendly Nations Visa."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">

    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
      <span class="text-slate-mid text-sm mx-2">/</span>
      <a href="/en/visas/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">Visas</a>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mt-4 mb-3">Panama Company Formation for Foreigners</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Forming a Sociedad Anónima (SA) is the most accessible way to establish an economic tie in Panama — and the most flexible path to qualify for the Friendly Nations Visa without a minimum investment amount.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="mb-10 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-jade mb-1">5–10</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Business days to incorporate</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-jade mb-1">$1,500</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Estimated initial cost (fees + disbursements)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-jade mb-1">0%</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Tax on income generated outside Panama</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why form a company -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">Why form a company in Panama?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-mid mb-5 leading-relaxed">
        Owning shares in an active Panamanian company is one of the <strong class="text-slate">four qualified economic ties</strong> for the Friendly Nations Visa — alongside employment with a Panamanian company, real estate ($200k+), and a term deposit ($200k+). Unlike the other three, the company route has no minimum capital requirement.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="text-xl mt-0.5">🏢</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Economic tie for the Friendly Nations Visa</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Holding shares in an active SA qualifies as an economic tie — no minimum investment required. The most affordable option for nationals of the 50 eligible countries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="text-xl mt-0.5">💼</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Legal structure for business activity</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Provide services, import/export, or simply maintain a local legal entity. The SA is the standard format for any commercial activity in Panama.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="text-xl mt-0.5">🌍</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Territorial tax system — foreign income untaxed</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Panama uses a territorial tax principle. Income generated outside the country — from foreign clients, remote work, or international investments — is not taxed in Panama.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="text-xl mt-0.5">🏦</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Improves bank account approval chances</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Having an active Panamanian company is one of the factors that improve the chances of opening personal and corporate bank accounts in Panama.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What is an SA -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-jade/15 bg-jade/3">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-4">What is a Panamanian Sociedad Anónima?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-mid mb-4 leading-relaxed text-sm">
        The <strong class="text-slate">Sociedad Anónima (SA)</strong> is the most common corporate structure in Panama. It is formed by a Public Deed before a notary and registered with the Public Registry. Key features:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-mid">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> Minimum 3 directors (can be foreign nationals residing outside Panama)</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> No minimum capital required by law</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> Shareholders are not personally liable for company debts</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> Can operate in Panama or serve as a holding for international assets</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> Requires a licensed Resident Agent in Panama (included in the service)</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-jade mt-0.5">✓</span> Annual Operations Notice (~$300) if operating within Panama</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Process -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">Incorporation process</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        {[
          { n: '01', title: 'Name and structure', desc: 'Choose an available name in the Public Registry, define share capital, number of shares, and directors.' },
          { n: '02', title: 'Articles of Incorporation', desc: 'The attorney drafts and notarizes the Deed of Incorporation before a Panamanian notary.' },
          { n: '03', title: 'Public Registry filing', desc: 'The deed is registered with the Commercial Registry — a process of 5 to 10 business days.' },
          { n: '04', title: 'Post-incorporation steps', desc: 'Obtain RUC (Tax ID), open a corporate bank account, and file Operations Notice if operating locally.' },
          { n: '05', title: 'Use as immigration tie', desc: 'With the active SA in place, the attorney certifies your shareholding to include in the Friendly Nations Visa application.' },
        ].map(step => (
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/10 bg-white items-start">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-jade bg-jade/8 px-2 py-1 rounded-md flex-shrink-0">{step.n}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">{step.title}</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">{step.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Costs -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">Estimated costs</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-jade/15">
              <th class="text-left py-3 text-slate font-semibold">Item</th>
              <th class="text-right py-3 text-slate font-semibold">Estimated cost</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-jade/8">
            <tr><td class="py-3 text-slate-mid">Legal fees for incorporation</td><td class="py-3 text-right text-slate">$800 – $1,200</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 text-slate-mid">Notary and registry disbursements</td><td class="py-3 text-right text-slate">$200 – $350</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 text-slate-mid">Resident Agent (annual)</td><td class="py-3 text-right text-slate">$250 – $400 / yr</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 text-slate-mid">Operations Notice (if operating locally)</td><td class="py-3 text-right text-slate">~$300 / yr</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 text-slate-mid">Annual government tax</td><td class="py-3 text-right text-slate">$300 / yr</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-mid mt-3">Costs are estimates and vary by attorney and complexity. Contact us for an exact quote.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Not for you if -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gold/25 bg-gold/5">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-4">This is not for you if…</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-mid">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold mt-0.5">—</span> You are not a national of one of the 50 eligible countries for the Friendly Nations Visa — in that case, review the Qualified Investor Visa.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold mt-0.5">—</span> You want asset protection only, with no Panama activity — an SA holding may be excessive without international tax advice.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold mt-0.5">—</span> Your only goal is residency — if you have $200k available, a term deposit may be simpler than managing a company.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Ready to form your Panama company?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">We guide you through the process and coordinate with Panamanian immigration and corporate attorneys. No commitment, no pressure.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-sm bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">
          Get in touch →
        </a>
        <a href="/en/visas/friendly-nations/" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-sm border border-jade text-jade font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade/5 transition-colors">
          View Friendly Nations Visa
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
  <RelatedGuides lang="en" categories={['visas', 'proceso']} />
</Layout>
